# Cloudflare 静态资源缓存头（vite 会原样拷到 dist/）
# assets/ 下的 js/css 文件名带 hash，可长期缓存；其余资源（角色 glb、LUT、世界分块）文件名固定，更新后要能拿到新版
/assets/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/characters/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/assets/props/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/assets/lut/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/world/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
